        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Colorado_2/_scene_bull.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c1304248-3508-4da9-8412-8c7da771d2e4).Image",
        "Description": "47, your previous target in Whittleton Creek has been discovered to be part of a far-right militia group known as &quot;Colorado Freedom&quot;.\r\rOur client, a detective who investigated your hit in Whittleton Creek, wants us to take out three prominent members that are going to be involved in an attempt on the life of a human rights activist in the state. It seems like there may be more to this plan, outside of the organisation... we&apos;ll investigate.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
